WEBVTT

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:38.030
The Fourth Winter

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.590
Reverend of the Teachers, you have a letter.

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:43.010
Come in.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:57.880
Karisa, there is an extra faculty room, isn't there?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:00.960
Yes, there are two single rooms open.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:05.950
A new teacher will be joining us, so will you prepare the room?

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:08.930
That's sudden.  Is it a man?

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:14.860
Yes.  His name is Kiriku, a recent graduate and recommended by Tamuyuan.

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:18.270
A man, is it?

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:19.140
What's the matter?

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:23.060
Men treat the rooms roughly.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:30.850
Anyway, there hasn't been an off-season transfer like this since Erin came.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:37.340
The weather was like this that day too, wasn't it?

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:48.010
All right, you may begin.

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:49.420
The time limit is one tou.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:50.300
Got it.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.700
Your letter surprised me.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:15.330
You wrote, "I want my daughter to enroll there."

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.130
Sorry I imposed on you.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:17.830
Not that.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.470
I never heard that you had a daughter.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:25.220
Well, a lot has happened.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:29.340
I thought you would never come down from the mountains.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:31.470
That was my intention.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:33.360
But-

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:44.030
It's been only half a tou.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:45.990
Huh, really?

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:47.980
You're done?

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:49.540
Yes.

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:12.880
I heard Erin scored very well on that trial.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:17.430
If it was only a high score, I wouldn't have been so surprised.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:22.170
Even above the score, I was surprised by the essay she wrote.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:25.620
That's why I allowed her to enter Kazalm.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:31.780
And soon after starting her life at Kazalm, she met Lilan.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.640
It's not an adult yet.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:57.260
It's a baby.

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.010
Come in.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:07.520
Hold this.

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:14.150
If it starts to wake up while I'm treating it, blow it.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:21.990
This beast-lord was captured as a gift to the Queen for her birthday.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:31.130
The first time its sight was ever brought upon a human, as it was being petrified by the sound of the mute whistle,

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:36.130
its shoulder was shot through by an arrow targetting the Queen.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:51.330
This baby got separated from its mother, too.

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:58.320
That's why it's so frightened.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.330
<i>Mom!</i>

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.140
Erin?  What's wrong with you?

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:23.850
Nothing.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:26.610
I felt very sorry for it.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:32.830
Seeing Lilan not eat, she cried over her.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:36.960
I decided to make her in charge of Lilan.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:40.710
Yes!  I was so surprised by that!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:46.290
After all, you had a freshly-enrolled student take care of a beast-lord.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:52.790
At that time, Lilan had been hurt by a human, so she was more cautious of humans when compared to the other beast-lords.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:59.970
It may have seemed rash, but I felt there was something only she could do, being a person who had seen a wild beast-lord.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:01.720
That's why I made my decision.

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:12.120
Erin gave every minute of her day to Lilan when she wouldn't accept anything except water.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:16.730
At first, Lilan was cautious of Erin and was feeding upon her own fur,

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:21.610
but she got used to having Erin around, and eventually became docile.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:31.290
Erin took care of Lilan until she became better, sacrificing her sleep.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:33.210
Eat up, Lilan.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.500
It's really good.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:49.560
Then, with her experience of having observed wild beast-lords, and by being unaffected by common opinions,

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:52.910
she worked hard to find the answer.

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:58.650
Most people would have given up at where she stood,

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:00.320
but Erin was different.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:07.120
She recalled what wild beast-lords do, and came up with an idea.

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:42.330
I thought it was a good idea...

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:16.330
Erin figured out that the sound which echoed through the blanket was similar to the sound it had heard under its mother's stomach.

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:26.010
And she felt that if she could play the sound more accurately, she'd be able to communicate with Lilan better.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:28.970
So...

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:57.500
Esal-sensei!  Esal-sensei!

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.790
Come in.

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:01.930
What's the rush?

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:04.670
Lilan!  It's Lilan!

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:07.260
All right!  Stay away!

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.170
Don't come inside here!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:43.220
Lilan's...  Lilan's...

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:07.190
The smallest thing she came up with was something none of us teachers could have thought of.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.950
Though, as spectators, there were many moments of cold sweat.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:27.960
When she started to communicate with Lilan, she hadn't realized yet that it was something that would change her life.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:35.400
Erin is Wajyaku born, and lost her mother by means of an execution, which involved being fed to Touda.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:39.560
Slandering the people in the Queen's quarter by the name of Holon,

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:43.180
and those in the Grand Duke's quarter as Wajyaku has become common,

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:45.820
and they detest each other.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:53.940
In a culture like this, Erin has become a person with great influence to both sides.

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:58.270
Lilan.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:13.550
Then, if you'll excuse me.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.560
Erin, read this.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.500
Tousana Asan?

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:39.820
That's Jone Oji-san's son.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:41.120
That's right.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:53.300
"Early yesterday morning my father, Tousana Jone, passed away...

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:56.340
due to heart disease..."

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.010
Keep strong.

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:10.650
Erin, Jone wished for you to pursue academics here.

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.320
Take a look.

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:16.710
Jone left these to you.

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:22.160
He would clarify the words I couldn't read or materials that were hard to understand...

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.880
Good girl.

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:23.140
Wow.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.020
Esal-sensei...

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:13.320
Really.  How stupid of you.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:15.480
Three stitches on your earlobe.

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:17.820
And eight stitches on your shoulder, you know?

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:26.000
Hey, don't move so suddenly like that!

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.160
I'm sorry.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:39.640
You might have thought you were special since you became close to Lilan,

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:44.510
but because of that, it looks like you became oblivious to the apparent danger.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:49.350
I'm partly at fault for trusting you too much.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:53.240
Don't try to touch Lilan anymore.

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:01.330
That's something... I <i>won't</i> do.

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:07.870
Whether you like it or not, no means no.

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:09.320
You almost died!

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:10.950
I know!

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.200
I won't let my guard down again.

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:16.710
Lilan thinks of me as a mother.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:22.590
If I keep my distance from Lilan now, she might return to her original state.

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:24.460
You're dreaming!

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:29.430
Beasts only listen to others when they believe the one speaking is stronger.

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:32.890
Beast-lords are different from us humans.  They're beasts.

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:37.310
A mute whistle...

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:46.030
This is the only means humans have to prove that they are at an advantage over beast-lords.

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:51.910
If you think you're Lilan's mother, then use this to make Lilan obey you.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:56.540
It's not love that makes beast-lords listen to you.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.870
It's fear.

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:00.170
Understand?

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:06.840
Otherwise, don't think that you'll get away with only an injury next time.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.060
I swore never to use it.

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:19.140
In that case, write a will.

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:23.270
Write that it was your stupidity which caused your death.

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:24.830
You bring it upon yourself.

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:32.450
Hand it in to me, so there will be no problems.

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:49.480
Our harp...

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.710
Beast-lords are beast-lords.

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:37.810
As Esal-sensei says, it might be fear that beasts feel toward humans, and not love.

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:45.810
But is that really the only kind of relationship we can create?

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:53.290
That even though they obey humans, because they fear us...

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:59.700
Is fear really the only thing between humans and beasts?

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:08.340
I want to find that answer one day.

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:19.350
Even if it means taking the same path my mother took.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.670
It's snowing.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:28.110
We need to get ready for the winter.

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:29.610
You're right.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:32.960
How is Lilan doing?

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.560
Very well.  She's doing great.

00:21:38.930 --> 00:21:44.280
You're a college student now, so do whatever you think is for the best.

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:56.460
I will.  Thank you very much.

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:09.790
What I always wanted to know...

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:13.500
If it's Erin, she might be able to achieve what I couldn't.

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:18.840
I'm sure she'll find it.

00:22:56.400 --> 00:23:00.490
What do you think,

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:03.340
Jone?

00:24:01.900 --> 00:24:11.080
I've raised Lilan wishing to find out the difference between wild beast-lords and those at Kazalm.

00:24:11.700 --> 00:24:16.420
A new teacher comes to Kazalm when New Years is just around the corner.

00:24:16.420 --> 00:24:18.250
His name is Kiriku.

00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:21.970
A teacher who specializes in poisons, who comes from the capital.

00:24:21.970 --> 00:24:23.590
Kemono no Souja Erin.

00:24:23.590 --> 00:24:25.000
Light in the Sky.

00:24:25.000 --> 00:24:30.020
Light in the Sky
